 <div class="card"><b>Build progress — chunk 27.</b> Added <code>001_core.sql</code> in the root (one migration, 22 tables, 1 view). Covers users, patients, encounters, cases (with <code>demo_patient</code>, <code>alert_log</code>, <code>legacy_id</code> for idempotent import), <code>case_values</code>, <code>case_rows</code>, <code>case_notes</code>, element_sets (+ latest view), installed_packages, review_requests, review_events, set_usage, user_prefs, verified_codes, code_bindings, cds_rules, protocols, alert_acks, audit_log and imports. <code>case_rows</code> is separate from <code>case_values</code> so two staff can append readings at once without touching one record, and each reading has its own version, author and entered-in-error state. Database-level safety checks: a rule cannot be enabled without an approver and time; entered-in-error needs a reason; amendments need a reason; marketplace sets must be read-only; a reviewer cannot be the author; audit_log and review_events refuse UPDATE/DELETE (chunk 33 also revokes the grants). The localStorage-to-table mapping is at the end of the SQL file. 15 tests pass. Continue with chunk 28.</div>
 <div class="card"><b>Build progress — chunk 28.</b> REST API added in the root: <code>api.js</code> (all routes, zod strict validation, standard error format), <code>seed.js</code> (loads <code>element-sets.js</code> into <code>element_sets</code> as read-only seed rows), <code>api.test.js</code> (16 tests) and <code>API.md</code>. <code>server.js</code> mounts the API. Cases assemble into the prototype shape (<code>values["setId/@group"]</code> = row arrays, each row carrying <code>__id/__v/__by/__at/__status</code> metadata). Rows are append-only, edited with <code>expectedVersion</code> and hidden (never deleted) when entered in error with a reason; max 500 per group. Every versioned write returns 409 with <code>current</code> on conflict. Seed and read-only sets answer 403 to PATCH, DELETE and new-version POST. Rule and protocol approval is stamped by the server and editing resets it. Notes (draft, sign, amend) were included because the case shape needs them. Until chunk 32 the API acts as a development user and refuses to run when <code>NODE_ENV=production</code>. Not verified: <code>element-sets.js</code> was not available, so <code>seed.js</code> was tested with a stand-in file. 31 tests pass in total. Continue with chunk 29.</div>
